# Restless Prairie enters tapped on turn 1 and is a plain land. On turn 3 Bot1 pays {2}{G}{W} with four Moxen and animates it: until end
# of turn it is a 3/3 green and white Llama land creature (CR 613.1d, 613.4b). It attacks beside an Elvish Mystic and its trigger gives
# the other creatures Bot1 controls +1/+1 until end of turn - the Mystic (2/2) and the Ornithopter that stays home (1/3), not the Prairie
# itself (still 3/3) and not Bot2's Llanowar Elves (1/1). Nothing blocks: 3 + 2 damage (20 - 5 = 15). On turn 4 the pumps and the
# animation are gone (CR 514.2).

